100 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(You can accept or decline any of these.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

101 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(In the next few pages I will share some potential reasons for preterm birth, it is important to note that sometimes babyes do just come when they\220re ready!)/Pg 12 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

102 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 58 0 R/T( What do I need to do?      )/E( What do I need to do?      )/Pg 12 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

103 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(Preterm birth \(PTB\) is a fairly common complication of pregnancy, comprising around 8% of births in England and Wales. We consider any baby born before 37 weeks to be preterm \(NHS 2019\).  So you\220re not alone.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

104 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 58 0 R/T(         What is preterm birth?)/E(         What is preterm birth?)/Pg 12 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

105 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 58 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[358 0 R 0]/K[16]>>
endobj

